    "description": "<blockquote><p><strong>Requirements</strong>: You must have mastered the <strong>Tectonomancer</strong> Class, and must have acquired the <strong>Rogue's See You Later</strong> skill.</p></blockquote><p>You move through the Earth as shadows. When you sink into the ground with <strong>Earthmeld</strong>, you can choose to reappear as though you had used <strong>See You Later</strong>. You may take one willing creature with you when you do this.</p><p><em>Note: the main effect of this Heroic Skill is to let you run away with a friend as long as you can reach the ground. It feels Roguish to be able to abduct foes with this Skill, but I struggled with how to word that and it seems like a sinister talent for a Fabula hero to have...</em></p>",
